                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.50 Recovery/6–3048: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Stuart</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1948-06-30T20:00:00-04:00">June 30, 1948—8 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>965. Dept cannot ignore NAC recommendation Article V para 5 formerly Article VII
                    (Embtel 1149 June 25 repeated Shanghai as 525 et seq.) ECA has agreed to
                    resubmit question to NAC by telephone poll NAC members tomorrow (July 1). Dept
                    will immediately communicate decision to Emb. Meanwhile Emb should not dispose
                    finally this paragraph and should be prepared submit NAC language before
                    conclusion negotiations.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Marshall</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
